# Docker build context for the server image is the repo root (see
# docker-compose.yml's `server.build` and server/Dockerfile) — needed so that
# Dockerfile can COPY the root pnpm-lock.yaml/pnpm-workspace.yaml for a
# workspace-aware, frozen-lockfile install of just @arix/server. Everything
# below is either irrelevant to that image or something that should never be
# baked into a layer.
#
# The dashboard image builds from its own context (./dashboard) with its own
# dashboard/.dockerignore — unaffected by this file.

# Unrelated workspace member — the server image never needs it.
dashboard

# Never bake real secrets into an image layer.
.env
.env.*

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
server/test

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.log
coverage
**/coverage
docs
*.md
.atl
